    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kayin kodi Abel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Adam obedo gi cege Eva aka ogamo iye to nywolo Kayin ka waco ama: “Gi kony pa Rwoth alimo wodan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eva doko onywolo wode man, Abel. Abel oyido obedo jakwath rombo, aka Kayin obedo jafur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma hongo moro Kayin okelo olemo pere paka mic ri Rwoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 11:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka Abel okelo nyathi rombo makayo, acel kwoŋ rombo pere to thumo, aka omiyo adec mabeyo paka mic. Rwoth ojolo mic pa Abel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka okwero mic pa Kayin. Ameno Kayin nge omako swa, to coko nyime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Kayin ni, “Raŋo nge omakin? Raŋo icoko nyimin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabedi oyido itimo gim'otire, dinyo ibwonjo. To rupiri itimo gimarac, reco gwaro thigo perin mito dhumin; t'iripo dhumo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
